  unitName: King Jason (EU)
  unitId: 740145
  unitNumber: 7071
  description: King Jason of the Golden Highlands stopped his journey for power recently;
    he has deeply fallen in love to Queen Jade. During the day he feels strong and
    happy by her side, but at night he can't stop the nightmares... each time his
    head falls from his neck, over and over again...
  summonDesc: Greetings summoners! It's for my lover, but if you're here... I guess
    I can help you too?
  fusionDesc: More strength to protect the woman I love.
  evoDesc: New strength! It's for my lover, but if you're here... I guess I can help
    you too?
